  "question": {
    "text": "A cylinder of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is kept on an inclined plane having an angle of inclination <math><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></math>. Axis of the cylinder makes an angle<math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>with the line along the greatest slope. Assuming that cylinder rolls without slipping, the acceleration of the cylinder is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0015_edb09b652ddf.jpg\" style=\"height: 184px; width: 250px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
