  "solution": {
    "text": "Acceleration of the cylinder is given by<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0015_edb09b652ddf.jpg\" style=\"height: 184px; width: 250px;\" />"
